      "number_raw": "111",
      "source_number": "111",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I'm not surprised.  Most of the new members of our city come in with the caravans, even with the missing caravans we've had. It's a fine city, but be careful who you associate with.  People like Decker and his thugs can get you into a lot of trouble.",
      "source_text": "I'm not surprised.  Most of the new members of our city come in with the caravans, even with the missing caravans we've had. It's a fine city, but be careful who you associate with.  People like Decker and his thugs can get you into a lot of trouble.",
